  "name": "WF-GS-05: BCP Auto Payment Confirmation",
  "description": "Polls Gmail for BCP payment emails, extracts reference, queries Supabase, and auto-confirms pending payments to activate workspace plans.",
  "active": false,
  "isArchived": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-GS-05: BCP Auto-Payment Confirmation\n\n**Trigger**: Gmail polls sergio.urcullo.m@gmail.com every minute\n**Filter**: from=BolBancaMov@bcp.com.bo + subject=\"Interbancaria QR\"\n\n**Flow**:\n1. Extract PAGO-XXXXX-timestamp from email body/snippet\n2. Lookup in Supabase: payment_requests WHERE reference=X AND status=PENDIENTE\n3. If found: PATCH payment to CONFIRMADO + PATCH organization.plan\n\n**Setup**: Configure \"Supabase GestiOS\" credential (supabaseApi type)\nand \"Gmail sergio.urcullo\" credential (Gmail OAuth2).",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "335372f4-4043-4eb8-b532-00ef5c8a08ec",
      "name": "Sticky Note f43106ab",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        416
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "readStatus": "unread",
          "sender": "BolBancaMov@bcp.com.bo"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9bb2150a-6e4d-4948-b763-30ede8d9c243",
      "name": "BCP Email Received",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        192
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "noe1vRlyVTHo74tB",
          "name": "Gmail account 3"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\nconst snippet = item.snippet || \"\";\nconst bodyParts = item.payload?.parts || [];\nlet fullText = snippet;\nfor (const part of bodyParts) {\n  if (part.body?.data) {\n    try {\n      fullText += \" \" + Buffer.from(part.body.data, \"base64\").toString(\"utf8\");\n    } catch(e) {}\n  }\n}\nconst match = fullText.match(/PAGO-[A-Z0-9]+-\\d+/);\nconst reference = match ? match[0] : null;\nreturn [{ json: { reference, emailId: item.id, fullText: fullText.slice(0, 500) } }];"
      },
      "id": "5c7027e4-9027-4d86-ad7a-021872d6f432",
      "name": "Extract Reference from Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        224,
        192
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.reference }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1027b4ba-a5bd-4bd6-b49f-bb564a521936",
      "name": "Reference Found?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        448,
        192
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://dlcwmqylhctpuimtfqrs.supabase.co/rest/v1/payment_requests?reference=eq.{{ $json.reference }}&status=eq.PENDIENTE&select=id,organizationId,plan,months,amountBOB,reference",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
